{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds and approaches object. It takes the object, checks its properties. Avoids obstacles or moves randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = DetectObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    />",
